 "words": 106,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I was a sinner far from God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And did not know the way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But then I heard the word of life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That speaks to you today",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For God so loved the world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That he gave his only Son",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So that everyone who believes in him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Should not perish but have eternal life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I will sing it out to all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who are weary, who are small",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is not for the good alone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It is grace from God for all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For God so loved the world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That he gave his only Son",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that everyone who believes in him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.33,
